<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75137" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρκ-ωμόσια</span></b> , τά,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>asseverations on oath,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				241a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρκια</span>
			, <i>sacrifice on taking a solemn oath</i> or <i>swearing to
				a treaty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν ὁ. καύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					120b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				229.82
			</span></i> (Smyrna, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).287
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				67
			</span></i> (sg., Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1007.29
			</span></i> (sg., Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρκωμόσιον, τό,</span> name of a
			place in Athens where a treaty or alliance had been sworn to, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				27
			</span></i>.</div>
